<title>HONG KONG: Deutsche sets warrants on China Overseas.</title>
<headline>Deutsche sets warrants on China Overseas.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Bank AG, London Branch, on Thursday set finalised terms for its 1.38 billion American-style call warrant issue on shares of China Overseas Land &amp; Investment Ltd.</p>
<p> Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$2.745	    PREMIUM	9.1 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.061	    GEARING	5.04X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  9.OCT.97	    PAYDATE	18.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	   LISTING DATE 25.OCT.96</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$3.075</p>
<p> NOTES   PHYSICAL EXERCISE DELIVERY ONLY</p>
<p>	   GOVERNING LAW IS HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
